@startuml activity-build
!theme plain
title Litho Build Activity Diagram (with Swimlanes)

|Author|
start
:Create/Edit .md file;
:Select template;

|Conversion Channel|
:Invoke build via CLI, editor, web app, MCP, or API;

|Interpreter|
:Tokenize & Parse;
:Build AST;
:Load template schema/manifest;
:Bind to template;
